#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/fontconfig.xml:83
#, xml-text
msgid "Required"
msgstr "Exigida"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/fontconfig.xml:85
#, xml-text
msgid "<xref linkend=\"freetype2\"/>"
msgstr "<xref linkend=\"freetype2\"/>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/fontconfig.xml:88
#, xml-text
msgid "Optional"
msgstr "Opcionais"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/fontconfig.xml:90
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"bubblewrap\"/> (used by some tests), <xref "
"linkend=\"curl\"/> and <xref linkend=\"unzip\"/> (both used by some tests "
"for downloading and extracting test files), <xref linkend=\"json-c\"/>, "
"<xref linkend=\"docbook-utils\"/> and <xref linkend=\"libxml2\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"texlive\"/> (or <xref linkend=\"tl-installer\"/>)"
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"bubblewrap\"/> (usado por alguns testes), <xref "
"linkend=\"curl\"/> e <xref linkend=\"unzip\"/> (ambos usados por alguns "
"testes para baixar e extrair arquivos de teste), <xref linkend=\"json-c\"/>,"
" <xref linkend=\"docbook-utils\"/> e <xref linkend=\"libxml2\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"texlive\"/> (ou <xref linkend=\"tl-installer\"/>)"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/fontconfig.xml:103
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have <application>DocBook Utils</application> installed and you "
"remove the <parameter>--disable-docs</parameter> parameter from the "
"<command>configure</command> command below, you must have <xref "
"linkend=\"perl-sgmlspm\"/> and <xref linkend=\"texlive\"/> installed also, "
"or the <application>Fontconfig</application> build will fail."
msgstr ""
"Se tiver <application>DocBook Utils</application> instalado e remover o "
"parâmetro <parameter>--disable-docs</parameter> do comando "
"<command>configure</command> abaixo, [então] você precisa ter <xref "
"linkend=\"perl-sgmlspm\"/> e <xref linkend=\"texlive\"/> instalado também, "
"ou a construção do <application>Fontconfig</application> falhará."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/fontconfig.xml:114
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Fontconfig"
msgstr "Instalação do Fontconfig"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/fontconfig.xml:117
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Fontconfig</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>Fontconfig</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/fontconfig.xml:121
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr        \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc    \\\n"
"            --localstatedir=/var \\\n"
"            --disable-docs       \\\n"
"            --docdir=/usr/share/doc/fontconfig-&fontconfig-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc    \\\n"
"            --localstatedir=/var \\\n"
"            --disable-docs       \\\n"
"            --docdir=/usr/share/doc/fontconfig-&fontconfig-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/fontconfig.xml:129
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results, issue: <command>make check</command>.  One test is "
"known to fail if the kernel does not support user namespaces.  Some tests "
"will download some font files via Internet."
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>make check</command>. Um teste é "
"conhecido por falhar se o núcleo não suportar espaços de nomes de "
"usuário(a). Alguns testes transferirão alguns arquivos de fonte via "
"Internet."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/fontconfig.xml:135
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/fontconfig.xml:138
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/fontconfig.xml:141
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you did not remove the <parameter>--disable-docs</parameter> parameter "
"from the <command>configure</command> command, you can install the pre-"
"generated documentation by using the following commands as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Se não removeu o parâmetro <parameter>--disable-docs</parameter> do comando "
"<command>configure</command>, [então] você consegue instalar a documentação "
"pré-gerada usando os seguintes comandos como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/fontconfig.xml:147
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -v -dm755 \\\n"
"        /usr/share/{man/man{1,3,5},doc/fontconfig-&fontconfig-version;/fontconfig-devel} &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 fc-*/*.1         /usr/share/man/man1 &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 doc/*.3          /usr/share/man/man3 &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 doc/fonts-conf.5 /usr/share/man/man5 &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 doc/fontconfig-devel/* \\\n"
"                                  /usr/share/doc/fontconfig-&fontconfig-version;/fontconfig-devel &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 doc/*.{pdf,sgml,txt,html} \\\n"
"                                  /usr/share/doc/fontconfig-&fontconfig-version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -v -dm755 \\\n"
"       /usr/share/{man/man{1,3,5},doc/fontconfig-&fontconfig-version;/fontconfig-devel} &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 fc-*/*.1         /usr/share/man/man1 &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 doc/*.3          /usr/share/man/man3 &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 doc/fonts-conf.5 /usr/share/man/man5 &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 doc/fontconfig-devel/* \\\n"
"                                  /usr/share/doc/fontconfig-&fontconfig-version;/fontconfig-devel &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 doc/*.{pdf,sgml,txt,html} \\\n"
"                                  /usr/share/doc/fontconfig-&fontconfig-version;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/fontconfig.xml:160
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/fontconfig.xml:163
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--disable-docs</parameter>: This switch avoids building the "
"documentation (the release tarball includes pre-generated documentation)."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--disable-docs</parameter>: Essa chave evita construir a "
"documentação (o tarball de lançamento inclui a documentação pré-gerada)."

